{"symbol":"SATTRIX","yahoo":"SATTRIX.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Sattrix Information Security Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","website":"https://www.sattrix.com","about":"Sattrix Information Security Limited provides information security solutions and related services internationally. The company offers security solutions, such as incident response, automation and response, device management, helpdesk and tech support, IT infrastructure support, compliance, detection and response, and vulnerability management. It also provides strategic advisory and implementation support, including technology consulting and transportation, and IT cost optimization; security assessment services comprising vulnerability and infrastructure assessments, penetration testing, application audit, code review, and assessment and advisory services. In addition, the company offers cybersecurity expert services comprising compliance, SOAR, and IR as a service, as well as hybrid SOC management, SIEM consulting, and MSS for the stockbrokers' community. Further, it provides Splunk, Palo Alto, Fortinent, Cortex, NewEvol, ArcSight, Zoho, and Google security operations solutions. Sattrix Information Security Limited was incorporated in 2013 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:55:14+00:00","quote":{"price":355.3,"prevClose":355.3,"marketCap":403.19,"high52":451.0,"low52":226.05,"pe":32.04,"bookValue":178.63,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":6.75,"shares":1.1348,"insiders":77.3,"institutions":8.06},"prices":{"dates":["2024-06-12","2024-06-13","2024-06-14","2024-06-18","2024-06-19","2024-06-20","2024-06-21","2024-06-24","2024-06-25","2024-06-26","2024-06-27","2024-06-28","2024-07-01","2024-07-02","2024-07-03","2024-07-04","2024-07-05","2024-07-08","2024-07-09","2024-07-10","2024-07-11","2024-07-12","2024-07-15","2024-07-16","2024-07-18","2024-07-19","2024-07-22","2024-07-23","2024-07-24","2024-07-25","2024-07-26","2024-07-29","2024-07-